# Two players, a single race on track 0 in split screen (docs/port/SYNTH.md 2). A port the script uses is connected.
# until: 0x400000:600
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 2, windows 2, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning
8 START        # the start prompt
9 RIGHT 0.1    # the main menu's first option: one player more (as many as controllers)
11 A           # the main menu: the race
14 A           # the player screen: each player is ready
14 A@2
17 A           # the mode screen: a single race
20 A           # the track select: track 0
23 A           # the car select: each player's car
23 A@2
